{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Lives To Escape</strong> is a hardcore 2D platformer where you control a brave orange cat trying to survive deadly traps, spikes, and puzzles \u2014 with only nine lives per level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and dodge through increasingly challenging levels filled with precision jumps, clever traps, and no mercy. You start each level with exactly 9 lives \u2014 lose them all, and you\u2019re back to the beginning, with all progress reset. Master each obstacle, learn from every failure, and prove that nine lives are just enough to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like <strong>Super Meat Boy</strong> and <strong>Celeste</strong>, this is a fast-paced test of reflexes, focus, and pure platforming skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 lives per level \u2014 every mistake counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly traps and pixel-perfect jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel art and a cartoon style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls made for speedrunning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of hardcore precision platformers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725960?t=1748595850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725960?t=1748595850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725960/799a41a5dd099a1ef161453737b21e1d2c040a8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748595850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725960/799a41a5dd099a1ef161453737b21e1d2c040a8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748595850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id"